{"about_the_game":"A Small Robot Story is an adventure-platformer where you play as Rae, a small robot who activates and has no idea why. So you need to set out and find out what's up! <br><br>With a heavy emphasis on story, A Small Robot Story will take you through forests, factories, caves, laboratories, and more as you track down and find the source of your sudden activation. <br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Power-ups<br></li><li>NES-styled challenging gameplay <br></li><li>Detailed story delivered through rpg-style dialogues and cut scenes<br></li><li>Gamepad support<br></li><li>Original chiptune soundtrack</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"a46f0db0ec9c6b7d9c77434b5e52ba468a04f4b7.jpg","localized_name":"Defeat Foreman","name":"Defeat Foreman","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/753440/a46f0db0ec9c6b7d9c77434b5e52ba468a04f4b7.jpg"},{"icon":"1743f7d65f1bbb4a7e555c1d1e95f314228d8810.jpg","localized_name":"Defeat the Giant Slime","name":"Defeat the Giant Slime","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/753440/1743f7d65f1bbb4a7e555c1d1e95f314228d8810.jpg"},{"icon":"b0ea7adb40cec5092f5c3ccbc3e4d072284de20f.jpg","localized_name":"Defeat A.N.D.Y.","name":"Defeat A.N.D.Y.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/753440/b0ea7adb40cec5092f5c3ccbc3e4d072284de20f.jpg"},{"icon":"e39ae9f45d0975a84ca0f8f50e6be1b4dc7f2d6c.jpg","localized_name":"Defeat Simon","name":"Defeat Simon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/753440/e39ae9f45d0975a84ca0f8f50e6be1b4dc7f2d6c.jpg"},{"icon":"06a1f35baa9a2654e4e641a6148bff86342d89e8.jpg","localized_name":"Protector of the Forest","name":"Protector of the Forest","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/753440/06a1f35baa9a2654e4e641a6148bff86342d89e8.jpg"},{"icon":"a25fff477ab5c639014c4736af4d431f3863d3eb.jpg","localized_name":"Into the drink!